      "hash64": "8F15F8F6083A7C00",
      "text": "「道館館主奇樹！\\n潛入傳聞中的那個學園！」[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
