    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_gym_denki_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "B99411EABED1F6CA",
      "text": "生態巨蛋的影片\\n整個爆紅了喔～！\\c\\n我頭上的小磁怪在電氣石岩窟裡\\n失控的那個部分是最大亮點！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
