      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_gym_denki_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "B99412EABED1F87D",
      "text": "學園也稱讚我做的影片是\\n「很好的宣傳」喔！\\r\\n顆呵，顆呵呵……[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
