      "label": "coach_gym_denki_sp03_04b",
      "hash64": "03256420E29A9851",
      "text": "不！我明白的！\\n雖然[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳嘴上這麼說……\\c\\n但[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的內心其實只想\\n和奇樹我合作對吧！？[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
